              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isithunywa sesine salukhalisa uphondo; kwatshaywa ingxenye yesithathu yelanga, leyenyanga, leyezinkanyezi, ukuze kufiphale ingxenye yesithathu yokukhanya kwazo; kwafiphala ingxenye yesithathu yokukhanya kwemini kanye lokwasebusuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.12",
