              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngasengikhangela, ngezwa ukhozi luphapha emkhathini lukhala ngelizwi elikhulu lusithi: Maye, maye, maye kulabo abakhileyo emhlabeni, lapho sekukhala impondo ezizakukhaliswa yizithunywa ezintathu zokucina!",
          "type": "text",
